## Resolved Registry

> Issues from the original 25-issue deep audit that have been fixed. Kept for context.

| ID | Title | Resolution |
|----|-------|------------|
| C1 | Hardcoded HMAC fallback secret | [SEC-003] — `gameStateValidator.ts:97-107` throws FATAL if `CHECKSUM_SECRET` missing. DONE 2026-06-29. |
| C2 | `isAccountLocked` returns `false` on DB errors | [SEC-002] — both error paths in `isAccountLocked` return `{ locked: true }`. DONE. |
| C3 | Unvalidated save import (no bounds) | `importSave()` removed entirely. `validateGameState()` + DB CHECK constraints enforce bounds. DONE. |
| C4 | `setGameSpeed` accepts any number | [SEC-009] — `setGameSpeed` validates against `[1, 2, 5, 10]`. DONE. |
| C5 | Trading Post bypasses server validation | [PRF-006], [SEC-001] — all trades go through `/api/game/trade` with full validation. DONE 2026-07-07 (Phase 3). |
| H1 | DashboardPanel subscribes to entire store | [STO-001] — `useGameStore((s) => s.X)` pattern enforced. DONE. |
| H2 | In-memory rate limiter doesn't scale | [API-001], [API-002] — Supabase-backed rate limiter in place. PARTIAL (single-instance still OK; multi-instance needs Redis). |
| H3 | TOCTOU race in cheat flagging | [DB-007] — `increment_cheat_flag` RPC atomic. DONE. |
| H4 | 14 dead action types in `validActions` | [API-006] — reduced to 7 implemented actions; legacy names rejected. DONE. |
| H5 | `solarPanel` in both FactoryType and PowerPlantType | Not blocking; documented as type-system blemish. |
| H6 | Debounced persist loses up to 5s of data | [STO-006] — `beforeunload` flush + 2-min cloud sync. Known limitation on mobile force-kill. |
| M1 | Config updates don't trigger re-renders | [ARC-003], [ARC-005] — `instrumentation.ts` pre-warm + 60s balance poller. DONE. |
| M2 | `setImmediate` in `logActionAsync` | [SEC-008] — replaced with `queueMicrotask`. DONE. |
| M3 | Hardcoded income rates in tooltip | Verified — production calculator now feeds tooltip data. DONE. |
| M4 | Inaccurate `rpPerTick` calculation | Verified — uses real game logic from `balanceConfig.rp`. DONE. |
| M5 | Meaningless `storageUtilization` | Verified — uses real capacity from store. DONE. |
| M6 | Stale Prisma schema | [DB-012] — Prisma directory removed. DONE. |
| M7 | Admin auth via env var allowlist | [AUT-002] — DB-backed admin_users table is the source of truth. `ADMIN_UIDS` env var still exists for emergency super_admin seeding. PARTIAL. |
| M8 | Weak blueprint import validation | Server-authoritative refactor in v15 covers all paths. DONE. |
| L1 | `Math.random()` for IDs | [SEC-007] — `crypto.randomUUID()` for sensitive IDs. PARTIAL (some non-security uses remain). |
| L2 | `KEY_TAB_MAP` incomplete | Cosmetic. Not blocking. |
| L3 | `topResources` shows only raw materials | Verified — uses dynamic resource ranking. DONE. |
| L4 | `quickTradeAmounts` never updates | [ARC-002] — live prices from `useServerMarket` hook. DONE. |
| L5 | `handleReset` uses `confirm()` | Cosmetic. Not blocking. |
| L6 | `prisma` in dependencies, not devDependencies | [DB-012] — Prisma removed entirely. DONE. |

**Status summary:** 17 of 25 fully resolved. 8 partial/cosmetic (H2, H5, H6 known limitation, M7 partial, L1 partial, L2, L5).

**Post-audit work added (2026-07):**
- **Phase 3 Market Audit (F1-F5)** — auto-sell pressure reporting, warn catches, market constants → balanceConfig SSOT, circuit-breaker deadlock escape, trade-impact notification
- **Trade Post SSOT Step 1+2** — TRADE_COMMISSION_RATE / TRADE_COOLDOWN_SECONDS / SLIPPAGE_* / MAX_SLIPPAGE moved to `balanceConfig.trade.*` (server + client both read from getBalance)
- **Phase 5 Tier-5 Full Wiring** — tier-5 buildings, recipes 300-313, mega-project consumers, 9 endgame switch cases
- **Phase 5.5 Tier Centralization** — `tiers.ts` SSOT, architecture test enforces
- **Phase 6 UI Panel Audit** — all 23 panels audited
- **Server fail-closed guard** — `/api/game/trade` rejects non-finite pricing → 503

